  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2021-2026 Chevrolet Tahoe Bucket Seat\n2021-2026 GMC Yukon\nOnly fits with 2nd Row Bucket Seats\nOnly for Carpet Flooring.\nFeatures\nTailored Fit: Experience edge-to-edge coverage with our front, 2nd row, 3rd row, and cargo mats fit for 2021-2026 Chevrolet Tahoe Bucket Seat / 2021-2026 GMC Yukon; 3D laser measuring perfectly hugs the contour, creating a comprehensive barrier to your vehicle’s floor and trunk.\nSustainable Material: Our floor mats blend comfort, reliability, and sustainability; Made from heavy-duty, flexible TPE, a sustainable, rubber-like material, they contain no latex, PVCs, cadmium, and lead; Our floor mats make every journey more enjoyable\nWeather-tough Durability: Designed with high walls, ourFloor Mats efficiently contain messes; Built to endure all weather conditions, these mats won't crack, curl, or break, protecting your floor from rain, snow, mud, and spills year-round\nAssembly & Cleaning A Breeze: All floor mats feature a special retention system, retainer clips, and a non-slip texture for secure stability and slip resistance; Simply hose down or use a damp cloth for effortless cleaning\nPackage Contents: This set includes floor mats: 2 front floor mats, 1 second row floor mat, 1 third row floor liner, and 1 cargo mat; We work tirelessly to provide more efficient and comfortable floor protection than ever before",
